{
  "$comment": "design-md scaffold.py 输入示例（双主题，全部通过 WCAG AA）。字段：color / colorLight（{value, role} 或纯 hex 字符串）；font.family / font.size / font.weight；radius；spacing；zIndex；shadow。直接运行： python3 scripts/scaffold.py --tokens templates/design-tokens.example.json --out ./design-out",
